            <ArticleTitle>A conceptually novel construction of the 6a-hydroxypterocarpan skeleton - Synthesis of (±)-variabilin.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>6175-6177</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0968-0896(16)31100-2</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.bmc.2017.01.003</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A new access to the 6a-hydroxypterocarpan variabilin was established. Key step of this concise total synthesis is a challenging cyclization of a haloketone via halogen-metal exchange and subsequent intramolecular addition to the carbonyl function.</AbstractText>
